[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2620081557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102139#issuecomment-2620081557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102139","id":2620081557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cK0WV","user":{"login":"JameeKim","id":26984355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTg0MzU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26984355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim","html_url":"https://github.com/JameeKim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JameeKim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T21:21:59Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T21:21:59Z","body":"I can currently think of 3 ways to fix this:\n\n1. Keep track of whether the property value is read from `export_presets.cfg` or `.godot/export_credentials.cfg`, and take that into consideration in `EditorExport::_save()`.\n2. Defer loading export preset values until all plugins are loaded.\n3. Re-load export preset values after loading all plugins.\n\nI'm thinking that the first approach would be the easiest, but I would like opinions from other people who are much more familiar with the whole code. I'm also willing to create a PR myself if the needed change is not too big. I just want to make sure I'm seeing this the correct way before starting to do anything.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2620081557/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583200537","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102139#issuecomment-3583200537","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102139","id":3583200537,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Vk00Z","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T20:59:41Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T20:59:41Z","body":"Confirmed in v4.5.1.stable (Windows 11).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583200537/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3980948923","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102139#issuecomment-3980948923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102139","id":3980948923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tSHW7","user":{"login":"ErindiGR","id":33462126,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDYyMTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33462126?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR","html_url":"https://github.com/ErindiGR","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErindiGR/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T20:18:06Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T20:18:06Z","body":"I think I found the problem, but idk if I have enough experience with this repo to fix it without messing something up.\n\nIt looks like the problem is that the secret properties are checked if they exist in the preset properties, unlike the normal properties.\n\nBecause the secret properties are checked in the preset object that is created in `load_config` the preset doesn't contain the full preset properties (checked this in the debugger. The script extensions are probably added after` load_config`), which means the secret property never passes the check and doesn't get assigned the loaded value. Removing the check ( `if (preset->get_properties().has(E)) `) fixes the problem, but I assume the check is there for a reason, so it may cause other problems if removed.\n\n<img width=\"1132\" height=\"522\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e002d2e0-b260-416b-9fc4-087ee425a46b\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3980948923/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]